改造入口，两者同时启用","desc":""},{"id":"176","title":"ConfigureModifiedFlux","type":"ConfigureModifiedFlux","cat":"util","x":-2028,"y":284,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL"}],"widgets":[],"brief":"与 PAG 配套的 Flux 模型改造入口，两者同时启用","desc":""}],"links":[{"from":"13","fromOut":0,"to":"8","toIn":0},{"from":"22","fromOut":0,"to":"13","toIn":1},{"from":"46","fromOut":0,"to":"45","toIn":1},{"from":"48","fromOut":0,"to":"13","toIn":0},{"from":"50","fromOut":0,"to":"45","toIn":0},{"from":"49","fromOut":0,"to":"51","toIn":0},{"from":"51","fromOut":0,"to":"45","toIn":3},{"from":"41","fromOut":0,"to":"45","toIn":4},{"from":"38","fromOut":0,"to":"60","toIn":0},{"from":"6","fromOut":0,"to":"62","toIn":0},{"from":"78","fromOut":0,"to":"40","toIn":1},{"from":"80","fromOut":0,"to":"40","toIn":2},{"from":"60","fromOut":0,"to":"46","toIn":1},{"from":"17","fromOut":0,"to":"13","toIn":3},{"from":"62","fromOut":0,"to":"22","toIn":1},{"from":"131","fromOut":0,"to":"40","toIn":0},{"from":"8","fromOut":0,"to":"145","toIn":1},{"from":"8","fromOut":0,"to":"157","toIn":0},{"from":"55","fromOut":0,"to":"22","toIn":0},{"from":"145","fromOut":0,"to":"158","toIn":0},{"from":"52","fromOut":0,"to":"46","toIn":0},{"from":"55","fromOut":0,"to":"17","toIn":0},{"from":"160","fromOut":0,"to":"45","toIn":2},{"from":"160","fromOut":1,"to":"161","toIn":1},{"from":"45","fromOut":0,"to":"161","toIn":0},{"from":"161","fromOut":0,"to":"13","toIn":4},{"from":"161","fromOut":1,"to":"162","toIn":0},{"from":"162","fromOut":0,"to":"13","toIn":2},{"from":"152","fromOut":0,"to":"168","toIn":0},{"from":"8","fromOut":0,"to":"169","toIn":0},{"from":"155","fromOut":0,"to":"41","toIn":1},{"from":"40","fromOut":0,"to":"41","toIn":0},{"from":"163","fromOut":0,"to":"49","toIn":0},{"from":"163","fromOut":0,"to":"52","toIn":0},{"from":"78","fromOut":0,"to":"52","toIn":1},{"from":"80","fromOut":0,"to":"52","toIn":2},{"from":"78","fromOut":0,"to":"55","toIn":1},{"from":"80","fromOut":0,"to":"55","toIn":2},{"from":"168","fromOut":0,"to":"163","toIn":0},{"from":"155","fromOut":0,"to":"8","toIn":1},{"from":"40","fromOut":0,"to":"145","toIn":0},{"from":"154","fromOut":0,"to":"38","toIn":0},{"from":"154","fromOut":0,"to":"6","toIn":0},{"from":"163","fromOut":0,"to":"55","toIn":0}],"ai":{"s":"FlowEdit（FireFlow）零遮罩语义编辑：把'1 dog'的照片改写成'1 cat'，不涂遮罩、不重画构图。结构是两个串联的 SamplerCustomAdvanced：正向阶段 FlowEditForwardSampler 以 20 步沿加噪轨迹反演源图（BasicScheduler 的 sigma 经 FlipSigmas 反转、DisableNoise 确保全程不加新噪声），PrepareAttnBank 把途中记录的注意力库递给反向阶段；反向阶段 FlowEditReverseSampler 只用 3 步，在 OutFluxModelSamplingPred 包装的模型上按目标提示词去噪，注意力库把源图结构钉在原位，于是语义换了、布局不变。模型侧 Flux dev fp8 经 ConfigureModifiedFlux 进入 FlowEdit 修改态，正负文本各配 FluxDeGuidance 后由 BasicGuider 使用。结果与原图拼接预览，一眼核对编辑幅度。","u":["不涂遮罩直接换掉照片里的主体（狗换猫、物换物），保留原始构图","语义级修改发型/服装/材质，比 inpaint 少一道涂遮罩工序","Flux 图生图嫌 denoise 难调时，用注意力库方案保持背景不动","调参对比：ImageConcatMulti 把原图与结果左右拼接核对"],"d":3,"st":[{"name":"输入与缩放","desc":"载入源图并统一缩到 INTConstant 指定的 512 方图，编辑分辨率由这两个常量统一控制。","nodes":["131","40","78","80"]},{"name":"模型与文本","desc":"Flux fp8 经 ConfigureModifiedFlux 切入 FlowEdit 修改态（ApplyFBCache 默认旁路）；正负两段提示词各配 FluxDeGuidance 剥离内嵌引导。","nodes":["152","168","163","154","38","60","6","62"]},{"name":"正向反演","desc":"源图编码成潜图后，FlowEditForwardSampler 沿反转 sigma 加噪并记录注意力库，这是保留原图结构的全部依据。","nodes":["41","52","49","51","50","46","160","45","161"]},{"name":"反向编辑","desc":"目标提示词引导 FlowEditReverseSampler 三步去噪，注意力库约束改动范围，sigma 直接沿用正向调度。","nodes":["48","22","17","162","13","55"]},{"name":"解码与对比","desc":"结果解码后与缩放过的原图左右拼接预览，PurgeVRAM 顺手清显存。","nodes":["8","145","157","158","169"]}],"p":"两个 INTConstant（512）决定编辑分辨率，改大要同步关注显存；正向 20 步、反向 3 步是 fireflow 配方，反向步数加多会偏离原图；目标提示词的 FluxDeGuidance 值 3.5 控制编辑强度，嫌改不动就调大。","n":"fp8 Flux + t5xxl fp16 + 双阶段注意力库对显存不友好，建议 12GB 以上，图内已内置 PurgeVRAM；ApplyFBCacheOnModel 默认旁路，启用可提速但可能损细节；175/176 两个 ConfigureModifiedFlux 是未接线的冗余副本。"}}